#. Key:	EscapeTogetherDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(173)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(173)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,EscapeTogetherDesc"
msgid "You and Dragojlo built trust without losing yourself. You escaped the loop together."
msgstr "Ti i Dragojlo ste izgradili poverenje, a ti nisi izgubio sebe. Pobegli ste iz petlje zajedno."

#. Key:	ObedientFoolDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(177)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(177)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,ObedientFoolDesc"
msgid "You trusted completely and stopped deciding for yourself. The wrong voice chose your fate."
msgstr "Verovao si bezuslovno i prestao sam da odlučuješ. Pogrešan glas je izabrao tvoju sudbinu."

#. Key:	ColdBetrayalDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(181)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(181)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,ColdBetrayalDesc"
msgid "You relied on him but never respected him. One calm lie was enough."
msgstr "Oslanjao si se na njega, ali ga nikad nisi poštovao. Jedna mirna laž je bila dovoljna."

#. Key:	MergedMemoryDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(185)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(185)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,MergedMemoryDesc"
msgid "Your memories and his leaks intertwined. You can no longer tell who remembers what."
msgstr "Tvoja sećanja i njegova curenja su se preplela. Više ne znaš ko se čega seća."

#. Key:	TheReplacementDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(189)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(189)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,TheReplacementDesc"
msgid "He did not destroy you. He learned you. Now you are the voice on the other side of the line."
msgstr "Nije te uništio. Naučio te je. Sada si ti glas sa druge strane linije."

#. Key:	TheExitDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(193)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(193)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,TheExitDesc"
msgid "A wall that was not there. A door nobody mentioned. You walked home without asking him once. Something at home says you have been here before."
msgstr "Zid kojeg nije bilo. Vrata koja niko nije pomenuo. Otišao si kući a da ga nijednom nisi pitao. Nešto u kući kaže da si već bio ovde."

#. Key:	ParanoidSurvivorDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(197)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(197)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,ParanoidSurvivorDesc"
msgid "You escaped alone by trusting nobody. Maybe that saved you. Maybe it cost you the truth."
msgstr "Pobegao si sam jer nisi verovao nikome. Možda te je to spasilo. Možda te je koštalo istine."

#. Key:	EndingProgressFormat
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(221)
#: Source/Loop9/UI/EndingWidget.cpp(221)
msgctxt "Loop9Endings,EndingProgressFormat"
msgid "Endings seen: {0} of {1}   |   Anomalies spotted: {2} of {3}"
msgstr "Viđeni krajevi: {0} od {1}   |   Uočene anomalije: {2} od {3}"

